**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local
**/.dev.vars

# Logs
**/*.log
**/logs

# Editor / OS
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# Project artifacts not needed in container
.claude
docs
*.docx
README.md

# Docker files themselves (avoid recursive context)
Dockerfile
docker-compose.yml
.dockerignore
